kill":{"name":"冰霜冲击波","description":"掀起威猛冰霜冲击波，对前方敌人造成远程伤害，并附带击飞效果。","levels":[1,5],"damage":[180.0,180.0],"cooldown":[6.8,6.0],"ailment":"击飞"}}],"number":1}],"profile":{"Age":[20],"Height":[165],"Weight":[49]},"tribes":["魅魔"],"story":"比安卡，出身于名望贵族的魅魔千金。\n\n豪门小姐从小娇生惯养，被家人捧为掌上明珠，接受贵族家庭教育的比安卡举止端庄优雅。与生俱来的超强腕力和聪慧头脑，再加上从小受到的良好教育，让比安卡成为名副其实的文武双全杰出精英。她天生丽质，身着得体礼服，完美展现温婉淑女和气派绅士双重气质。比安卡品味高雅，落落大方，尤其对“美”别具慧眼。\n\n名门后裔比安卡无需像其他魅魔一样迷惑对方来吸取元气，她擅长召唤寒冰来抑制敌人靠近自己。故此，欠缺迷惑能力。富裕的家境，保障了比安卡生计毫无后顾之忧。在学校里，她的成绩一直名列前茅，除“娇媚”必修课差一点不及格以外，其他课程学分都非常优秀。\n\n比安卡和柚子是同窗，因柚子的魅魔一族必修课“娇媚”成绩可谓压倒群芳，比安卡的毕业综合成绩只能屈居第二。难以接受的挫败感，使得比安卡心里滋生对柚子的强烈竞争意识。毕业前夕，原本在必须提交的就业志愿表里填写“交响乐团指挥”为理想职业，看到憧憬冒险的柚子充满幻想的眼神之后，职业一栏偷偷改成了“冒险家”。相反，对柚子而言，比安卡只是兼备美貌与智慧的好同学。柚子从不耍心眼，总是和颜悦色待人，忿忿不平的比安卡也拿她没有办法。","storyKey":"profile_succubus_noble_story","sources":{"hero":"heroes.json / OriginId=350","profile":"heroprofile.json / OriginId=350","strings":"strings-zhCN.json","items":"items.json / TargetCharacterIds, ExclusiveCharacterId","voiceLines":["strings-zhCN.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-enUS.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-jaJP.json / Voice_*, cv_*"]},"voiceLines":[{"id":"succubus_noble","label":"普通","lines":[{"type":"NormalBattleWin","label":"胜利-普通战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["哼～轻轻松松。"],"enUS":["Hmpf. Easy peasy. "],"jaJP":["ふん！他愛もないわ"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_NormalBattleWin"]},{"type":"BossBattleWin","label":"胜利-首领战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["柚子，你看到我怎么打败它的吗？"],"enUS":["Yuze, did you see how big the boss I destroyed was?"],"jaJP":["ユズ、私が活躍する所ちゃんと見てたかしら？"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_BossBattleWin"]},{"type":"Die","label":"阵亡","texts":{"zhCN":["好气啊…我怎么可能…会输…！"],"enUS":["Infuriating… It's not like me… to end here…!"],"jaJP":["この私が…まさか…！"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_Die"]},{"type":"GetExp","label":"获得经验结晶","texts":{"zhCN":["我的指尖越来越凉。"],"enUS":["My fingertips are getting colder and colder. "],"jaJP":["指先がどんどん冷たくなっていくわ"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_GetExp"]},{"type":"LevelUp","label":"升级","texts":{"zhCN":["还不够，我必须变得更强！"],"enUS":["Not enough. I must get stronger!"],"jaJP":["こんなところで止まっていられない、更に強くならないと！"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_LevelUp"]},{"type":"EquipWeapon","label":"佩戴装备","texts":{"zhCN":["好！正合我意，谢谢。"],"enUS":["C'est bon! I like it, thank you. "],"jaJP":["C'est bon！気に入ったわ、ありがとう"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_EquipWeapon"]},{"type":"EquipCostume","label":"穿戴时装","texts":{"zhCN":["好看？这比我的睡衣还便宜的…"],"enUS":["You call this pretty? It's cheaper than my pajama at home…"],"jaJP":["これのどこが美しいの？私のナイトウェアより安物じゃない"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_EquipCostume"]},{"type":"Evolve","label":"进化","texts":{"zhCN":["雪冰变得更纯净了。"],"enUS":["My ice has become purer. "],"jaJP":["私の氷がさらに輝いていく！"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_Evolve"]},{"type":"Attack1","label":"攻击1","texts":{"zhCN":["哈呀！"],"enUS":["Hayaa-!!"],"jaJP":["はっ！"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_Attack1"]},{"type":"Attack2","label":"攻击2","texts":{"zhCN":["嚇啊！"],"enUS":["Hiyyaap!"],"jaJP":["いやっ！"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_Attack2"]},{"type":"Attack3","label":"攻击3","texts":{"zhCN":["冻结！"],"enUS":["Whooa!"],"jaJP":["凍らせてやる！"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_Attack3"]},{"type":"Skill1","label":"技能1","texts":{"zhCN":["感受死亡的冰冷吧。"],"enUS":["Feel the cold death. "],"jaJP":["冷たき死の淵へ堕ちなさい！"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_Skill1"]},{"type":"Skill2","label":"技能2","texts":{"zhCN":["冰魂雪魄！"],"enUS":["Freeze!"],"jaJP":["凍りつけ！"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_Skill2"]},{"type":"Damaged1","label":"受到攻击1","texts":{"zhCN":["呃！"],"enUS":["Argh!"],"jaJP":["うっ！"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_Damaged1"]},{"type":"Damaged2","label":"受到攻击2","texts":{"zhCN":["我…不疼…！"],"enUS":["It… doesn't hurt…!"],"jaJP":["痛くなんて…ないわ！"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_Damaged2"]},{"type":"PlayerChooseBright","label":"人物友善值选项","texts":{"zhCN":["啧，不愧是柚子的搭档。和她一样喜欢当老好人。"],"enUS":["Hmpf. Who says you aren't Yuze's partner. Such a fool, being so nice like her. "],"jaJP":["ふん！そのバカみたいにまっすぐなところ、あなたの相棒のユズにそっくりね"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_PlayerChooseBright"]},{"type":"PlayerChooseDark","label":"人物邪恶值选项","texts":{"zhCN":["直言不讳，我喜欢～"],"enUS":["Fufu. Bold and straightforward, I like it. "],"jaJP":["ふふっ、容赦ないわね、そっちのほうが好感が持てるわ"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_PlayerChooseDark"]},{"type":"WeakEnemyBattleStart","label":"与弱小敌人战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["无聊…又不好看…"],"enUS":["Those boring dimwits… Not beautiful…"],"jaJP":["美しくもない弱者どもね…"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_WeakEnemyBattleStart"]},{"type":"NormalEnemyBattleStart","label":"与普通敌人战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["长得还算能看吧。但你能安静点吗？"],"enUS":["Enemy with tolerable looks. But can't you be more quiet?"],"jaJP":["相手ならしてあげる、だからもう少し静かにしてちょうだい"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_NormalEnemyBattleStart"]},{"type":"StrongEnemyBattleStart","label":"与强大敌人战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["强敌？不要发出怪声，真没教养。"],"enUS":["Powerful enemy? How uneducated, thumping like that!"],"jaJP":["なかなかの強さみたいだけど、教養を感じないわね"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_StrongEnemyBattleStart"]},{"type":"BossBattleStart","label":"与首领战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["首领？当箭靶的最佳体型～！"],"enUS":["Boss? The wide body makes it a perfect target to throw ice!"],"jaJP":["強敵ね…けど、どれだけ大きくても、凍り付かせてあげるわ"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_BossBattleStart"]},{"type":"JoinParty","label":"首次加入队伍","texts":{"zhCN":["我从来不迷惑任何人，是他们自己迷上我的。"],"enUS":["I don't seduce anyone. They just become seduced, that's all. "],"jaJP":["私は誰も誘惑なんてしないわ、勝手に寄ってくるだけ"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_JoinParty"]},{"type":"CoopAttack","label":"战斗-攻击","texts":{"zhCN":["寒冷未曾使我恐惧。"],"enUS":["The cold never bothered me anyway. Attack!"],"jaJP":["少しも寒くないわ！攻撃よ！"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_CoopAttack"]},{"type":"CoopHeal","label":"战斗-请求治疗","texts":{"zhCN":["…我需要治疗…"],"enUS":["Argh… I need… heal…"],"jaJP":["くっ… ヒールを…"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_CoopHeal"]},{"type":"CoopRun","label":"战斗-注意","texts":{"zhCN":["退后！"],"enUS":["Get back!"],"jaJP":["少し下がってなさい！"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_CoopRun"]},{"type":"CoopWin","label":"战斗-胜利","texts":{"zhCN":["频频获胜，越发美丽！"],"enUS":["The more I win, the more beautiful I get!"],"jaJP":["勝利を重ねる度、更に美しくなっていく気分よ！"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_CoopWin"]},{"type":"CoopMVP","label":"战斗-最佳队员","texts":{"zhCN":["MVP？谢谢！不过我早就预料到了…"],"enUS":["MVP? Thanks! I was expecting it though, fufu."],"jaJP":["MVP？予想はしていたけど、それでも嬉しいものね、ふふっ"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_CoopMVP"]},{"type":"CoopHi","label":"战斗-问候","texts":{"zhCN":["别以貌取人，我可不是花瓶。"],"enUS":["Don't judge someone by their looks. I'm not just a blondie. "],"jaJP":["顔だけ見てビジュアル担当だと勘違いされては困るわ"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_CoopHi"]},{"type":"CoopHurryUp","label":"战斗-急迫","texts":{"zhCN":["快，趁寒冰还没有融化！"],"enUS":["Now! Before the ice melts!"],"jaJP":["早く！氷が溶ける前に！"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_CoopHurryUp"]},{"type":"CoopBelieve","label":"战斗-信任","texts":{"zhCN":["我会让你颤抖的，不管是因为寒冷还是因为恐惧。"],"enUS":["I'l make everyone shiver. Whether with cold or fear. "],"jaJP":["寒さと、恐怖に震えたいのかしら？"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_CoopBelieve"]},{"type":"TouchReactionGood1","label":"触碰反应-积极1","texts":{"zhCN":["我一开始并不想成为冒险家…但我能理解为什么柚子会选择这条路。"],"enUS":["I didn't plan to be an adventurer from the start but… I get why Yuze chose this path. "],"jaJP":["初めから冒険家を目指していたわけではないの、けれど…どうしてあの子がこの道を選んだか、分かる気がするわ","初めから冒険家を目指していたわけではないの、けれど、どうしてあの子がこの道を選んだか、分かる気がするわ"]},"keys":["Voice_succubus_noble_1_TouchReactionGood1","cv_succubus_noble_TouchReactionGood1"]},{"type":"TouchReactionGood2","label":"触碰反应-积极2","texts":{"zhCN":["什么…？柚子托你来看看我…？哈！怎么？她是想炫耀自己是第一名吗？！"],"enUS":["What? Yuze said hello? I-Is she trying to rub it in my face?!"],"jaJP":["えっ……？ユズがよろしく伝えてって……？な、何よっ！私に勝ったからって、いい気になって！"]},"keys":["Voice_succubus_noble_1_TouchReactionGood2","cv_succubus_noble_TouchReactionGood2"]},{"type":"TouchReactionBad1","label":"触碰反应-消极1","texts":{"zhCN":["怎么？你第一次看到我这样的魅魔吗？"],"enUS":["Why? Is it your first time seeing an ice cold succubus?"],"jaJP":["どうしたの？氷のように冷たいサキュバスは初めてかしら？まあ、私しかいなものね"]},"keys":["Voice_succubus_noble_1_TouchReactionBad1","cv_succubus_noble_TouchReactionBad1"]},{"type":"TouchReactionBad2","label":"触碰反应-消极2","texts":{"zhCN":["你是柚子的搭档？啧啧，柚子的喜好，真不敢恭维…"],"enUS":["You're Yuze's partner? She has weird taste…"],"jaJP":["あなたがユズの相棒？あの子、変な趣味してるわね…"]},"keys":["Voice_succubus_noble_1_TouchReactionBad2","cv_succubus_noble_TouchReactionBad2"]},{"type":"NoticeMail","label":"邮件提示","texts":{"zhCN":["邮件？嗨…不会又是奇怪粉丝寄来的信吧…？"],"enUS":["Mail…? Phew… Another of those strange fan mails?"],"jaJP":["メール？ふう… また変わったファンレターね？"]},"keys":["Voice_succubus_noble_1_NoticeMail","cv_succubus_noble_NoticeMail"]},{"type":"NoticeEvent","label":"活动提示","texts":{"zhCN":["有活动！激动到指尖发麻…"],"enUS":["Event, the excitment is freezing my fingertips…!"],"jaJP":["イベントですって！？期待感で指先が凍ってしまうわ！"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_NoticeEvent"]},{"type":"SummonSpeech1","label":"召唤-台词1","texts":{"zhCN":["魅魔名门望族的独生女，比安卡来了。"],"enUS":["I believe I'll have to say hello in a courteous manner for decency."],"jaJP":["呼ばれたからにはきちんと挨拶をしないとならないわね"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_SummonSpeech1"]},{"type":"SummonSpeech2","label":"召唤-台词2","texts":{"zhCN":["呼～把我召唤出来，出于礼节也该郑重地打招呼吧！"],"enUS":["From the prestigious succubus family, Lady Bianca at your service."],"jaJP":["サキュバスの貴族、ビアンカよ"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_SummonSpeech2"]},{"type":"SummonSpeech3","label":"召唤-台词3","texts":{"zhCN":["拭目以待吧，我可是独一无二的魅魔。"],"enUS":["Hope you're ready for me, for I am nothing like other succubi."],"jaJP":["期待以上のことはしてみせるわ"]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_SummonSpeech3"]}]},{"id":"succubus_noble_myth","label":"开花","lines":[{"type":"NormalBattleWin","label":"胜利-普通战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["连消遣都算不上。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_myth_NormalBattleWin"]},{"type":"BossBattleWin","label":"胜利-首领战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["再厉害的首领，也只能俯首于我的脚下。柚子，你觉得这么说如何？"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_myth_BossBattleWin"]},{"type":"Die","label":"阵亡","texts":{"zhCN":["这份耻辱…！我绝不承认…！"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_myth_Die"]},{"type":"LevelUp","label":"升级","texts":{"zhCN":["我还未臻完美。必须变得更加锋利、更加冰冷。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_myth_LevelUp"]},{"type":"Attack3","label":"攻击3","texts":{"zhCN":["赐予你冰冷的沉默。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_succubus_noble_myth_Attack3"]},{"type":"Skill2","label":"技能2","texts":